  "title-post": "How do you manage the flow of a fast-food restaurant at the foot of the slopes?",
  "current-post-image-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67e6aa84e60ec3ec4cf0eb28_IMG_3606%20(1).avif",
  "current-post-image-sizes": "100vw",
  "current-post-image-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67e6aa84e60ec3ec4cf0eb28_IMG_3606%20(1)-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67e6aa84e60ec3ec4cf0eb28_IMG_3606%20(1)-p-800.avif 800w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67e6aa84e60ec3ec4cf0eb28_IMG_3606%20(1)-p-1080.avif 1080w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67e6aa84e60ec3ec4cf0eb28_IMG_3606%20(1).avif 1165w",
  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67e65fdf6927b77524b4011d_l'express%20avoriaz.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "How do you manage the flow of a fast-food restaurant at the foot of the slopes?",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <h2>A concept born in the heart of the Alps</h2>\n          <p>Originally from Morzine, <strong>Alex</strong>, founder of L'Express Avoriaz, grew up in a family of restaurateurs and hoteliers. After a brilliant career between Lausanne, Lyon and Paris, he decided to leave Parisian life to join the family business and take up a new challenge: <strong>launching a fast-food restaurant at 1800 meters altitude</strong>, right in the heart of Avoriaz.</p>\n          <p>The aim? To offer fast, high-quality catering at the foot of three chairlifts, in a resort popular with French and international customers.</p>\n          <blockquote><em>\"We thought of L'Express as a complement to our bistronomic restaurant just above, Chez Flo. The idea was to go fast, well, and independently.\"</em></blockquote>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:1144pxpx\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67e667973a120c867396c690_IMG_3603%20(1).avif\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <h2>Managing intense flows... in an extreme context</h2>\n          <p>Ski resorts are synonymous with special constraints. And there are many of them:</p>\n          <ul role=\"list\">\n            <li><strong>Transporting goods</strong> at altitude</li>\n            <li><strong>Optimized deliveries</strong> ahead of the season</li>\n            <li><strong>Intense rushes</strong> in February and March, concentrated on lunch breaks</li>\n            <li><strong>A 500m² terrace</strong> to manage in all weathers</li>\n          </ul>\n          <blockquote><em>\"We discovered what it was like to scoot down empty beer kegs on snow...\"</em></blockquote>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <h2>A digital solution for the field</h2>\n          <p>To meet these challenges, L'Express has opted for digitalization with Innovorder : </p>\n          <ul role=\"list\">\n            <li><strong>Multilingual ordering station</strong> for international customers (French, English, Spanish, German, etc.)</li>\n            <li><strong>Production screens (KDS)</strong> to streamline order picking</li>\n            <li><strong>Online ordering</strong> for time-poor ESF, ESI and EVO2 instructors</li>\n          </ul>\n          <blockquote><em>\"Without the production screens, we'd never have been able to keep up with the pace. That's what enabled us to keep our promise of speed.\"</em></blockquote>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:1167px\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67e667fdec8325a63a408ac8_IMG_3605%20(1).avif\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <h2>A promising first season</h2>\n          <p>The facility opened its doors in December 2024, and after four months of operation, the results are positive:</p>\n          <ul role=\"list\">\n            <li><strong>Rapid familiarization</strong> of teams with the tool</li>\n            <li><strong>Ultra-smooth</strong> operation thanks to terminals</li>\n            <li><strong>Good flow management</strong> in the kitchen </li>\n          </ul>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <h2>What next?</h2>\n          <p>Alex announces: the next step is to <strong>structure the bar even further</strong>, integrate daily specials into the menu, and perhaps even move to <strong>table service</strong>.</p>\n          <h3>-</h3>\n          <p>Are you a restaurant owner or looking to launch your own restaurant? Call in an Innovorder expert and find out how to manage your restaurant's workflow and boost your business!</p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "L'Express Avoriaz",
